    },
    {
     "packet": 6,
     "field": "tcp.len",
     "value": "43"
    },
    {
     "packet": 7,
     "field": "tcp.dstport",
     "value": "9042"
    },
    {
     "packet": 7,
     "field": "tcp.len",
     "value": "19"
    }
   ],
   "frames": [
    {
     "packet": 6,
     "offset": 54,
     "hex": "04 00 00 00 09 00 00 00 22 00 00 00 1e 53 45 4c 45 43 54 20 76 20 46 52 4f 4d 20 6b 73 2e 74 20 57 48 45 52 45 20 6b 20 3d 20 3f"
    },
    {
     "packet": 7,
     "offset": 54,
     "hex": "04 00 00 00 0a 00 00 00 0a 00 05 70 69 64 2d 31 00 01 00"
    }
   ]
  },
  "notes": [
   "G-CQL-6 状态门：PREPARE/EXECUTE 需 STARTUP→READY 之后（design §9.2 缺失格）；故本例补 startup/ready 前置，包数 9→11（testcase §3.5 原形在门落码后非法）。"
  ]
 },
