 {
  "id": "cql_stream_correlation",
  "proto": "cql",
  "summary": "A' (G-CQL-7): non-zero stream correlation — two requests (stream 1/2), responses returned out of order (stream 2 first), each response stream matches its request",
  "spec_json": {
   "layers": [
    {
     "ip": {
      "src": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst": "20.0.0.1"
     }
    },
    {
     "tcp": {
      "src_port": 12345,
      "dst_port": 9042
     }
    },
    {
     "cql": {
      "wire_profile": "cql_v4",
      "events": [
       {
        "kind": "startup",
        "direction": "c2s",
        "options": {
         "CQL_VERSION": "3.0.0"
        }
       },
       {
        "kind": "ready",
        "direction": "s2c"
       },
       {
        "kind": "query",
        "direction": "c2s",
        "stream": 1,
        "query": "SELECT 1",
        "consistency": 1,
        "query_flags": 0
       },
       {
        "kind": "query",
        "direction": "c2s",
        "stream": 2,
        "query": "SELECT 2",
        "consistency": 1,
        "query_flags": 0
       },
       {
        "kind": "result",
        "direction": "s2c",
        "stream": 2
       },
       {
        "kind": "result",
        "direction": "s2c",
        "stream": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "expect": {
   "packet_count": 13,
   "has_handshake": true,
   "terminates": true,
   "has_payload": true,
   "directional": true,
   "fields": [
    {
     "packet": 6,
     "field": "cql.stream",
     "value": "1"
    },
    {
     "packet": 7,
     "field": "cql.stream",
     "value": "2"
    },
    {
     "packet": 8,
     "field": "cql.stream",
     "value": "2"
    },
    {
     "packet": 9,
     "field": "cql.stream",
     "value": "1"
    },
    {
     "packet": 6,
     "field": "cql.opcode",
     "value": "7"
    },
    {
     "packet": 9,
     "field": "cql.opcode",
     "value": "8"
    }
   ],
   "frames": [
    {
     "packet": 6,
     "offset": 54,
     "hex": "04 00 00 01 07 00 00 00 0f 00 00 00 08 53 45 4c 45 43 54 20 31 00 01 00"
    },
    {
     "packet": 7,
     "offset": 54,
     "hex": "04 00 00 02 07 00 00 00 0f 00 00 00 08 53 45 4c 45 43 54 20 32 00 01 00"
    },
    {
     "packet": 8,
     "offset": 54,
     "hex": "84 00 00 02 08 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 01"
    },
    {
     "packet": 9,
     "offset": 54,
     "hex": "84 00 00 01 08 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 01"
    }
   ]
  },
  "notes": [
   "stream 是本协议的关联关系承载字段（design §11.2）：请求 stream X 的响应 stream 必为 X（v4 §2.3）；乱序响应由事件序声明表达。",
   "断言 stream 值经 tshark cql.stream（FT_INT16，signed）解出。"
  ]
 },
